  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Capacity for Teachers, School Leaders and Teacher Aides for Inclusive Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will work with national and regional teacher training institutions and other stakeholders to improve pre-service and in-service training for teachers, school leaders and teacher aides to improve inclusive education practices in classrooms in Fiji, Vanuatu, Niue, Cook Islands and Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
